WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.906
This query creates two follow-up timestamps The
original discharge

00:00:05.932 --> 00:00:11.745
time remains visible Then PostgreSQL adds
fourteen-day and thirty-day

00:00:11.771 --> 00:00:18.008
intervals Keeping the original and derived times
side by side makes the transformation

00:00:18.034 --> 00:00:19.468
easy to audit and explain
